<title>FINLAND: TABLE-FISKARS H1 PROFIT RISES 58 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FISKARS H1 PROFIT RISES 58 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   219 vs 139</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  20.00 vs 11.40</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,418 vs 1,096</p>
<p> Operating profit				   173 vs 126</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of eight analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>durable consumer goods group Fiskars Oy's profit before extras</p>
<p>and tax had been 166.5 million markka (range 157 - 204 mln).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
